{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>無線台慶劇《璀璨之城》今晚（15日）播出的一集迎來全劇高潮！由陳瀅飾演的記者霍佩樺（Sarah），為了與官孝賢（張智霖飾）達成合作，竟然在對方的臥室裡上演極限挑戰，當眾解開襯衫並脫下外衣和牛仔褲，最後只穿黑色喱士內衣褲對鏡頭，最後更大膽全裸展現完美身段，並要求對方為自己拍攝。</p><figure><img alt=\"（劇集截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187524344595877888695314.jpeg/EQ008HyLLeYxNwDtOrn-A3fwtu_GjKZZzavxds2r8XY\"/><figcaption>（劇集截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（劇集截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187524342234353664194273.jpeg/mHwRUKL4qPl181KHQ3exJx5IIjiejphnzx84Sc8fOEk\"/><figcaption>（劇集截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（劇集截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187524339977687040015846.jpeg/eI3jWR3a7y119wz7Hqc8bpyMcESV_EjPvE6wtbxOsLU\"/><figcaption>（劇集截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（劇集截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187524349365063680059832.jpeg/coM-mfdMowyRYBr3Tdqal-3Vw4p58KISFmYobhZmKG4\"/><figcaption>（劇集截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（劇集截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187524339780554752895604.jpeg/NeisbD5cFVFP443rjh7arQisGkkiKyj79R0xlPUdMZQ\"/><figcaption>（劇集截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（劇集截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187524347204866048956012.jpeg/DoduTd5KqtdkJ_ILde9v-deV7mR-DaZNbgFJqG4BSag\"/><figcaption>（劇集截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（劇集截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187524342263713792694132.jpeg/Otu4QKny-Hwbl7UkUomt5nqxw79rSe7hcx1oBHMdaAQ\"/><figcaption>（劇集截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（劇集截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187524344579100672953086.jpeg/CT-n7QyrtMhZ6MtRAZgeqka40_43vCo6WHL53lhy-d4\"/><figcaption>（劇集截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>張智霖在劇中一臉嚴肅，默默看着陳瀅這一幕大膽舉動，兩人的對手戲火花四濺，張力十足！據悉，陳瀅為了這場「脫衣全裸戲」秘密狂操9個月，才練就出毫無贅肉的極致曲線。她事後坦言，雖然現場做足防走光措施，但要在眾多工作人員和男主角面前脫衣，依然緊張到面紅，擔心尺度太踩界。這場驚心動魄的對手戲一經播出，隨即引發全網熱烈討論！</p><figure><img alt=\"（劇集截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187524879654850560793146.jpeg/A38kDn0Bcf_3grwdJReKqx1C3XO7Ido87lhy4-5YcuM\"/><figcaption>（劇集截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（劇集截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187524877431738368039651.jpeg/uAk78lig0Q6Tfn5mjsCz7-Xz9KtKpbiKCPecTAj3nEw\"/><figcaption>（劇集截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（劇集截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187524875191848960913246.jpeg/l06P-kj_xf90arL-vOw3-rzy5HM-UaUehIWf7ISFn-w\"/><figcaption>（劇集截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（劇集截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187524884730220544671890.jpeg/7MnsqBxr_uhMSjPO6eYPUHyGVIu81mkP4TJSF-EyUhc\"/><figcaption>（劇集截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（劇集截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187524882259644416014268.jpeg/85jlXR2rw5SXmjXSfikxwXqyg2fjQvBYk_BpsZPwabE\"/><figcaption>（劇集截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（劇集截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187524879885537280845179.jpeg/2anTvNkKKueq5Ppc2UxrMz0eVtvW-6C8kPEnwpDxJ8I\"/><figcaption>（劇集截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（劇集截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187524877704368128078512.jpeg/ZOYH-2k86p526WDC4IgFkSUOx-GFZAsL_LHGp_yxxqc\"/><figcaption>（劇集截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（劇集截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187524875351232512280451.jpeg/Rq5ATUGnEWBi1NHw4niIc0UAHNKY8eT13y0rZt8tK2Y\"/><figcaption>（劇集截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"腿張開。（劇集截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187526157763874816195872.jpeg/4Bj48KHF3In659UElvX6BLaMe6wsA3sNL5-7dC-fu3Q\"/><figcaption>腿張開。（劇集截圖）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T14:20:38.884321+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":419,"images":17,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T14:04:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T14:17:49.443746+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T14:17:49.443746+00:00","content_hash":"9662148f7117665b8b569cb6dd968b46b35072e9d1ed1c49e1f6cfbcf9b45b28","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}